{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersed in the bleak aftermath of nuclear war, sneak your way through the dystopian streets of New London, shackled under the iron fist of a merciless regime. Your sole objective: Burn it all Down. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 1986. Infiltrate the now communist-controlled city of New London and employ every means at your disposal to dismantle the cult-like, totalitarian rule of the One-Eyed Dominion. Take aim at key political figures and structures, and unravel the oppressive regime one strategic move at a time.  <br><br>Will you be the catalyst for change, or will the people of New London succumb to this darkness forever? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773770/extras/40f9c5f15c9f1c74d1d0265507a3eb98.poster.avif?t=1754995610\" width=600 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773770/extras/40f9c5f15c9f1c74d1d0265507a3eb98.webm?t=1754995610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773770/extras/40f9c5f15c9f1c74d1d0265507a3eb98.mp4?t=1754995610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a unique arsenal of <strong>incendiary</strong>  <strong>equipment</strong> to wreak havoc on the enemy, from <strong>Molotov cocktails</strong>\u00a0to cannisters of oil, unleash the <strong>fire-bug</strong> within.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A versatile <strong>fire system</strong> - Approach each encounter from a new angle, using <strong>flames</strong> to manipulate, control, and devastate your <strong>enemies.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773770/extras/c9c23e4dcfbd8835ae51496b993b22a0.poster.avif?t=1754995610\" width=600 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773770/extras/c9c23e4dcfbd8835ae51496b993b22a0.webm?t=1754995610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773770/extras/c9c23e4dcfbd8835ae51496b993b22a0.mp4?t=1754995610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>hand-crafted environments</strong>\u00a0- Danger lurks behind every corner. Will you go by undetected or go out with a <strong>bang?</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reactive enemies</strong> that will <strong>hear</strong> you coming, dodge your attacks, and <strong>stalk</strong> your every misstep.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773770/extras/12706e1d76b427ca1d3d150be383f2c6.poster.avif?t=1754995610\" width=600 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773770/extras/12706e1d76b427ca1d3d150be383f2c6.webm?t=1754995610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773770/extras/12706e1d76b427ca1d3d150be383f2c6.mp4?t=1754995610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eliminate</strong> your <strong>enemies</strong> with precision. Take to the shadows or come out guns blazing, the choice is yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An\u00a0<strong>expansive sandbox</strong> that allows for player expression - Use any object you can get your hands on to deal whatever carnage you see fit. <strong>Blast</strong> your enemies with a <strong>double-barrelled</strong> shotgun, or  see how far you can get armed with nothing but a wheel of <strong>cheese.</strong> Your playstyle defines the carnage.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2773770?t=1754995610","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773770/5a4a388cfaf19043f6d31138b04bf0595df53987/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754995610","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773770/fc4b0fb558c52048880f67ffcabea4d47651cb35/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754995610","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773770/fc4b0fb558c52048880f67ffcabea4d47651cb35/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754995610","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersed in the bleak aftermath of nuclear war, sneak your way through the dystopian streets of New London, shackled under the iron fist of a merciless regime. Your sole objective: Burn it all Down. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 1986. Infiltrate the now communist-controlled city of New London and employ every means at your disposal to dismantle the cult-like, totalitarian rule of the One-Eyed Dominion. Take aim at key political figures and structures, and unravel the oppressive regime one strategic move at a time.  <br><br>Will you be the catalyst for change, or will the people of New London succumb to this darkness forever? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773770/extras/40f9c5f15c9f1c74d1d0265507a3eb98.poster.avif?t=1754995610\" width=600 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store